==English==

===Noun===
Zoroastrianism
# The ancient religion of Iran (persia) and also a mother-religion to all other abrahamic religions founded and reformed by [[w:Zoroaster|Zoroaster]] (1000 or 1100 BC), which teaches the worship of one god, ultimate good, [[w:Ahura Mazda|Ahura Mazda]], who is the only creator of the world and all the good things, and despise the ultimate evil, [[w:Ahriman|Ahriman]].

